1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,942
Can a tiny push lift a bigger load?

2
00:00:04,150 --> 00:00:06,492
Push here. The liquid transmits pressure.

3
00:00:08,150 --> 00:00:10,117
This piston has four times the area.

4
00:00:12,150 --> 00:00:14,118
Same pressure. Four times the force!

5
00:00:16,150 --> 00:00:18,506
But watch! It moves only one quarter as far.

6
00:00:21,150 --> 00:00:23,945
More force. Less distance. No free energy.

7
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:27,218
That’s hydraulics. Pretty clever, right?
